    },
    {
      "id": "04-t-87",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1190,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 408,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 254857198,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1425474642,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761523200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rules (ADR-0009)\n\n1. The installer creates C:\\GameWarden with inheritance\n    disabled and explicit entries only.\n2. SYSTEM never executes or loads a file from a path\n    that gamewarden-run can write.\n    → SteamCMD runs as gamewarden-run, never as SYSTEM.\n3. Core touches instance folders only while impersonating\n    gamewarden-run (WindowsIdentity.RunImpersonated), so a\n    planted junction cannot redirect a SYSTEM write or delete.\n4. Backups: files are read as gamewarden-run; the zip is\n    written as SYSTEM into backups\\.\n5. instances\\<id>\\ itself and instance.json stay\n    SYSTEM-owned; only the five subfolders are writable.",
      "originalText": "Rules (ADR-0009)\n\n1. The installer creates C:\\GameWarden with inheritance\n    disabled and explicit entries only.\n2. SYSTEM never executes or loads a file from a path\n    that gamewarden-run can write.\n    → SteamCMD runs as gamewarden-run, never as SYSTEM.\n3. Core touches instance folders only while impersonating\n    gamewarden-run (WindowsIdentity.RunImpersonated), so a\n    planted junction cannot redirect a SYSTEM write or delete.\n4. Backups: files are read as gamewarden-run; the zip is\n    written as SYSTEM into backups\\.\n5. instances\\<id>\\ itself and instance.json stay\n    SYSTEM-owned; only the five subfolders are writable.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rules",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 12
    },
